          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications cover Router replies and task updates in the default group of the selected workspace. Notifications change to the new workspace only after a successful switch. If switching fails, you may still receive notifications from the previous workspace." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notifications cover Router replies and task updates in the default group of the selected workspace. Notifications change to the new workspace only after a successful switch. If switching fails, you may still receive notifications from the previous workspace."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通知涵盖所选工作区默认群组中的 Router 回复和任务更新。切换成功后，通知才会改为新工作区；如果切换失败，你可能仍会收到之前工作区的通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications cover the default task group in one workspace at a time. Other task groups and workspaces aren’t supported yet. Notifications change to the new workspace only after a successful switch. If switching fails, you may still receive notifications from the previous workspace." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notifications cover the default task group in one workspace at a time. Other task groups and workspaces aren’t supported yet. Notifications change to the new workspace only after a successful switch. If switching fails, you may still receive notifications from the previous workspace."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒仅覆盖一个工作区的默认任务组，其他任务组和工作区暂不支持。切换成功后会改为新工作区；切换失败时，旧工作区可能继续发提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
